<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="he" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="default">
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="שמו״ת">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f2f3f8">
<title>שניים מקרא ואחד תרגום</title>
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.json">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/icon-192.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Frank+Ruhl+Libre:wght@400;700;900&family=Heebo:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
body{margin:0;background:#f2f3f8;font-family:'Heebo',-apple-system,sans-serif;}
#html-splash{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:999;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#eef2ff 0%,#f5f0ff 60%,#fff1f0 100%);
  padding:0 1.5rem;transition:opacity .5s ease;
}
#html-splash.sp-out{opacity:0;pointer-events:none;}
@keyframes sp-fadein{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
@keyframes sp-scalein{from{opacity:0;transform:scaleX(0)}to{opacity:1;transform:scaleX(1)}}
@keyframes sp-fadeonly{from{opacity:0}to{opacity:1}}
.sp-logo-pre{
  font-family:'Frank Ruhl Libre',serif;font-size:5.5rem;font-weight:900;line-height:1;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a56db,#7c3aed,#dc2626);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;
  margin-bottom:.5rem;
}
.sp-subtitle{
  font-family:'Frank Ruhl Libre',serif;font-size:1rem;font-weight:400;
  color:#4a5568;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:2.2rem;
  opacity:0;animation:sp-fadein .6s ease forwards;animation-delay:.75s;
}
.sp-divider{
  width:80px;height:2px;margin-bottom:2rem;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#7c3aed,transparent);
  border-radius:2px;
  opacity:0;animation:sp-scalein .8s ease forwards;animation-delay:1.15s;
}
.sp-quote-card{
  background:#fff;border-radius:28px;
  padding:1.8rem 2rem;
  box-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(100,110,200,0.12),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  text-align:center;direction:rtl;max-width:320px;width:100%;
  opacity:0;animation:sp-fadein .9s ease forwards;animation-delay:1.6s;
}
.sp-deco{font-size:2.8rem;line-height:1;color:#e5e7eb;font-family:Georgia,serif;display:block;margin-bottom:.3rem;}
.sp-quote{font-family:'Frank Ruhl Libre',serif;font-size:.98rem;font-style:italic;color:#374151;line-height:2.1;}
.sp-quote strong{font-style:normal;font-weight:700;color:#1f2937;}
.sp-paren{color:#9ca3af;font-style:normal;font-size:.88rem;}
.sp-source{
  margin-top:1.1rem;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;
  color:#7c3aed;letter-spacing:.06em;font-style:normal;
  opacity:0;animation:sp-fadeonly .6s ease forwards;animation-delay:2.8s;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="html-splash">
  <div class="sp-logo-pre">שמו״ת</div>
  <div class="sp-subtitle">שניים מקרא ואחד תרגום</div>
  <div class="sp-divider"></div>
  <div class="sp-quote-card">
    <span class="sp-deco">❝</span>
    <div class="sp-quote">
      אמר רב הונא בר יהודה אמר רבי אמי<br>
      לעולם ישלים אדם פרשיותיו עם הצבור<br>
      <strong>שנים מקרא ואחד תרגום</strong><br>
      <span class="sp-paren">אפילו עטרות ודיבון</span><br>
      שכל המשלים פרשיותיו עם הצבור<br>
      מאריכין לו ימיו ושנותיו
    </div>
    <div class="sp-source">מסכת ברכות, ח׳ ע״א–ע״ב</div>
  </div>
</div>
<div id="root"></div>
<script>if('serviceWorker' in navigator) navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js',{updateViaCache:'none'}).catch(()=>{});</script>
<script type="module" src="/src/main.jsx"></script>
</body>
</html>
